Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Silt Tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 36
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so much fun living here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.56,0:00:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.13,0:00:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But thinking back to that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,we were still terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.44,0:00:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did they bring us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A mere mud pit can’t hold me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.41,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s Wolffy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.69,0:01:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of Wolffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.57,0:01:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.01,0:01:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.34,0:01:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Nuan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.50,0:01:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms.?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.78,0:01:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What “Ms.”?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.06,0:01:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please address our Silt Tribe’s Queen by her proper title: Queen Nuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.26,0:01:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms…Queen Nuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.50,0:01:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don’t eat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.33,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You’ve misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.91,0:01:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw that you were injured,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.95,0:01:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,so we specifically soaked you in this healing mud to treat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.46,0:01:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My injuries have healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.58,0:01:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re too polite.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone who comes to our Silt Area is an honored guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.81,0:01:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But that {\i1}other{\i0} honored guest is a real handful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.37,0:01:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The other honored guest?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.11,0:02:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like your friend has woken up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.82,0:02:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Mud…it’s so dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.02,0:02:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My hairstyle!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fussing; this mud can heal your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lies! There isn’t a single good person in the Silt Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.50,0:02:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it’s {\i1}him{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We aren’t friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course—what right do you have to be friends with someone as noble as me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.86,0:02:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you’re the ones who caused me to fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.26,0:02:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You even injured my wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.03,0:02:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re blaming {\i1}us{\i0} for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I’m going to give you a chance to redeem yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Carry me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.43,0:02:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.94,0:02:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I am no longer myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.54,0:02:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My beauty, my fine qualities, and my noble soul have all been tainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll become a disgrace to all flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really that dramatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.25,0:03:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.13,0:03:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,there was a flower that fell into corruption after getting stained by mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, they were banished from the Flower Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.47,0:03:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god, I definitely don’t want that to happen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.23,0:03:20.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Can this mud of yours cure a brain problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.63,0:03:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t care; you have to take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and carry me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.24,0:03:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mud, mud, mud…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, just focus on recovering from your injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though it’s quite nice here…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.03,0:03:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,we still need to find the fragment quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.63,0:03:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, let’s split up and search for it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the Mentor has established trust with the Flower Baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,they can help the Flower Baby find a resonant flower in the Flower Area.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This creates an energy link between the Flower Baby and the flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This is called a “Spark”.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao managed to fall asleep right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.27,0:04:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He’s exactly like Paddi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay? Did Lan Baobao give you any trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of trouble? He was very well-behaved today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.03,0:04:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He just said he was going out to exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.15,0:04:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Exercise?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.43,0:04:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with exercising?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao is incredibly mischievous.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he promised you something,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.31,0:04:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,don’t let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.99,0:04:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the years,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.30,0:04:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,countless mentors were scared off by his mischief.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.74,0:04:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time he’s about to act up, he says he’s going out to exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He calls it “training”, but really, he’s just setting traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.52,0:05:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And he’s even flashing a sly grin while doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.91,0:05:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s exactly the sort of thing you have to watch out for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mischievous?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We take our hot spring baths up here on the surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.12,0:05:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,but the Silt Tribe actually lives underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.31,0:05:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you’re a guest, let us try out our mud-scrubbing technique on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.88,0:05:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t come here to…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Try here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.88,0:05:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the fragment?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.12,0:05:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know your stuff; these withered leaves are our most precious food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat more, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.00,0:05:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Try this one too, and this one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.99,0:05:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Apply some of our mud mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.07,0:05:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mud is the best, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like neither of us found a fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where should we look next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.09,0:06:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go take a look too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.97,0:06:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Xi Huahua, let me show you the flowers near my home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.77,0:06:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao, look how cute this flower is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.85,0:06:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Mentor Xi Huahua, come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something good to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you just stare at this flower, you’ll…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.00,0:06:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That flower is really dangerous; luckily, I was quick-witted enough to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You’re fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.12,0:06:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But {\i1}I’m{\i0} in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually blocked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.51,0:06:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve got another trick up my sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s have a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.72,0:07:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go over there and take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.08,0:07:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.56,0:07:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste of effort for my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You should rest for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.63,0:07:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,To think you actually survived three rounds—you really live up to the name Xi Huahua.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.87,0:07:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.63,0:07:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m becoming more and more confident in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, we have to hold the main gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.72,0:07:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t let those Flower Bugs get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.68,0:08:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, stay safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They’re just bugs; do we really need to be so nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.64,0:08:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.52,0:08:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind—let me figure out a way to escape first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.05,0:08:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s no use; there are too many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.06,0:08:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.86,0:08:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.50,0:08:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll help too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.13,0:08:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Planie, don’t push yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.53,0:08:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.52,0:08:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What exactly have these bugs come here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.04,0:08:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They’ve come looking for withered leaves to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.92,0:08:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking—let’s get ready to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.45,0:08:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Cleaned myself off with the withered leaves—perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.09,0:08:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And this way, I won’t have to touch the silk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I really am a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of monster is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.14,0:09:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? It’s so sticky.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to believe this thing can’t handle him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.34,0:09:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine. Let’s go find the Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Xi Huahua. This is a gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he goes again—how long is he going to keep playing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.10,0:09:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and open the gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If I open the gift, will you agree to start looking for the Spark?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.83,0:09:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You’d better open it quickly. I’m going to tidy up the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.83,0:09:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon, Xi Huahua will get angry because I’m teasing him,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.67,0:09:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and eventually give up on being my mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.55,0:09:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There are flowers that love to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:09:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There are flowers that love to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.10,0:10:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, he’s a pretty good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.24,0:10:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister, who patched this hole for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t Xi Huahua patch that up for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.47,0:10:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,His technique wasn’t great; he kept crying out in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.55,0:10:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.48,0:10:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven’t prepared that gift yet; I’ll give it to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.35,0:10:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You promised me you’ll go look for the Spark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.67,0:10:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve already promised you, so how could I not go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.87,0:10:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But I have to tell you, I’ve never actually found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.36,0:10:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,After we Flower Babies are born,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,we either evolve into a Flower Tribe member or a Silt Tribe member.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone wants to be like you—to find the Spark through hard work,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,to become an outstanding, beautiful Flower Tribe member.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.87,0:10:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But for a Flower Baby like me—with no special qualities or talent…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.59,0:11:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,if I were to take the trial, I’d definitely evolve into a Silt Tribe member.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Elders always say the Silt Tribe is terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn’t want to become part of the Silt Tribe, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So that’s why you kept acting like a mischievous Flower Baby to drive the mentors away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.55,0:11:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you were afraid of evolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you say you have no good qualities?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually show real talent in the mischievous things you design.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.83,0:11:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.07,0:11:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me—I’m an expert in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That’s great—I actually have a strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Xi Huahua, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.76,0:11:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve only shared this with you, Mentor Xi Huahua; please keep it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Mentor Xi Huahua, but I…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.01,0:11:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lan Baobao,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:11:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,there’s something I want to tell you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.28,0:11:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to tell me not to be late tomorrow, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.04,0:12:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You don’t need to worry about that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I’m actually looking forward to it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.47,0:12:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Right—that’s the spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.21,0:12:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s give it our all tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
